ano finalmente entusiasta sotto la stessa bandiera.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2013-03-21","status":"Released","rating":6.2,"ratingCount":714,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["Italy"],"facts":{"Runtime":"100m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":55914,"name":"Claudio Bisio","role":"Peppino","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cDhzyPQ3446zpRmP523rPFkkl4h.jpg"},{"id":120832,"name":"Kasia Smutniak","role":"Janis","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t7pf7Lsfxzt0QqILBB1mmCbf81U.jpg"},{"id":132419,"name":"Giuseppe Fiorello","role":"Politician With Goatee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xAoJWBNXdATMEtRmXeiYobPdy1f.jpg"},{"id":41527,"name":"Remo Girone","role":"Morelli","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gRS90yn20ZMlq4pvVQjtUM5DLqN.jpg"},{"id":131632,"name":"Massimo Popolizio","role":"Simple Politician","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4k0rslj9VtRUpr5APdPXQyeAIkH.jpg"},{"id":225770,"name":"Cesare Bocci","role":"Handsome Politician","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/60zz901Iz00C845DJpfs8wU29vV.jpg"},{"id":27208,"name":"Omero Antonutti","role":"General Secretary","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3JLrGj8i0tmTkvBJV7aEWVstNvW.jpg"},{"id":147835,"name":"Michele Alhaique","role":"Piero","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQp9Xh581Oh0A7AMvrpj5sorRUY.jpg"},{"id":1389992,"name":"Franco Ravera","role":"Luciano","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lEPf5KkzFofnIYcbXeo50CtMOtx.jpg"},{"id":128020,"name":"Gianni Cavina","role":"Mr. Fausto","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcTHRfLI8yCkEV3FGENXy0AsHoY.jpg"},{"id":1525832,"name":"Patrizio Rispo","role":"General Cavallo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fFU6sUZysUoyrUCfnV9qUSNoXHu.jpg"},{"id":18852,"name":"Pietro Sarubbi","role":"Brazilian President","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wTBez9bp1cE0KqDoKlsU1ujzBDA.jpg"},{"id":67321,"name":"Piera Degli Esposti","role":"Janis' Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r3r14DNxCWJ5SjqaaQbF4QnjhqL.jpg"},{"id":72786,"name":"Gigio Morra","role":"Drunk","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n4osWBIcJVgs7KyoaFZPxaBJfYD.jpg"},{"id":68271,"name":"Federico Galante","role":"Center-Right Leader's Assistant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyBIqsfcCQdlMkLdcOPDIStSNu6.jpg"},{"id":26265,"name":"Lina Wertmüller","role":"Potere Forte","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z7eLMwj24lWekZnzxNrWKbI3oxb.jpg"},{"id":72191,"name":"Pupi Avati","role":"Potere Forte","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zP1RXV5NEoGZSrWSE6ub6kO3oJC.jpg"},{"id":1525836,"name":"Gianni Rondolino","role":"Potere Forte","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/WoC6V4KmvRz1VXrrPz5PUNnBpC.jpg"},{"id":1525833,"name":"Helga Cossu","role":"Helga Cossu","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bcRtaV8QY2GzvNEc0Sa3Cd2DqIc.jpg"},{"id":1525834,"name":"Roberto Tallei","role":"Roberto Tallei","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nsv1bFCYttpUZ4Fzw8aG7ucWr9M.jpg"},{"id":1926085,"name":"Cristiana Ambrosoli","role":"Romona","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k4BkSHPaISkQTGHYUDpS8ULHw6s.jpg"},{"id":66815,"name":"Armando De Razza","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cc6jUaH7fTfcqASSmARdDUb0RaL.jpg"},{"id":1849303,"name":"Girolamo Di Stolfo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ND6LPUI3Yjt9YXcGSUbAX7e7sH.jpg"},{"id":2327055,"name":"Margherita De Francisco"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"In un piccolo paesino di montagna vive un uomo dal nome impegnativo: Giuseppe Garibaldi, per tutti Peppino. Ama la pesca, la compagnia degli amici, la biblioteca in cui lavora da precario. E' un ottimista anche se il figlio lo accusa d'essere un fallito. Un giorno, a causa di un pasticcio dei politici, accade una cosa incredibile: Peppino viene eletto per errore Presidente della Repubblica Italiana. Strappato alla sua vita tranquilla, si trova a ricoprire un ruolo per il quale sa di essere evidentemente inadeguato, ma il suo buonsenso e i suoi gesti istintivi risultano incredibilmente efficaci. Certo il protocollo non è il suo forte. Janis Clementi, inflessibile quanto affascinante vice segretario generale della Presidenza della Repubblica, si affanna inutilmente nel tentativo di disciplinare le imprevedibili iniziative del Presidente...","tagline":"Giuseppe Garibaldi riunisce il popolo italiano finalmente entusiasta sotto la stessa bandiera."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Welcome Mr. President!","overview":"In a small mountain village lives a man with a challenging name, Giuseppe Garibaldi (one of Italy's \"fathers of the fatherland\"), but everybody call him with the nickname Peppino. Love fishing, the company of friends, the library where he works as a precarious employee. He is an optimistic person even if his child accuse him of being a wannabe. One day, due to a mess of politicians, an amazing thing happens: Peppino is mistakenly elected President of the Italian Republic. Pulled out from his quiet life, is to play a role for which he knows he is obviously inappropriate, but his common sense and his instinctive gestures are incredibly effective, except for the etiquette, for which he is in trouble. The inflexible and fascinating Deputy Secretary General of the Presidency of the Republic, Janis Clementi, is anxious to no avail in an attempt to regulate the unpredictable actions of the President..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gDs0UPzIeqUgYL0qIaWepJ7Uk9v.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5PbtDm52osa3WvW9BDIePxlvaoZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":178915,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","ur